ari; Venetian painter."},{"id":"LE102-422070572124cdb3","title":"First Ottoman siege of Vienna","kind":"history","reference":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Siege_of_Vienna_(1529)","aliases":["First Ottoman siege of Vienna"],"photos":[],"questionIds":["ARCHED-NEW101-0472","ARCHED-NEW101-0494"],"tapestryIds":["t63-6a26aaffbc8e"],"museumIds":[],"mapIds":[],"note":"Suleiman's campaign."},{"id":"LE102-526acda0882b730b","title":"Giambologna","kind":"person","reference":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Giambologna","aliases":["Giambologna"],"photos":[],"questionIds":[],"tapestryIds":["t63-d7349acf70e5"],"museumIds":[],"mapIds":[],"note":"Flemish-born sculptor active in Italy."},{"id":"LE102-0869230f640df1bd","title":"Ivan IV","kind":"person","reference":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ivan_the_Terrible","aliases":["Ivan IV","Ivan IV crowned tsar"],"photos":[],"questionIds":[],"tapestryIds":["t63-782e907c4aa6","t63-c4e88e5471ef"],"museumIds":[],"mapIds":[],"note":"Tsar of Russia."},{"id":"LE102-a00c0274ece9c75a","title":"Jean Bodin","kind":"person","reference":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jean_Bodin","aliases":["Jean Bodin"],"photos":[],"questionIds":[],"tapestryIds":["t63-88ed4fe313f6"],"museumIds":[],"mapIds":[],"note":"Political writer and jurist."},{"id":"LE102-b8bf9e34cf957647","title":"The Prince: publication","kind":"art","reference":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Prince","aliases":["The Prince: publication"],"photos":[],"questionIds":[],"tapestryIds":["t63-31ac167557f4"],"museumIds":[],"mapIds":[],"note":"Written chiefly in 1513; published posthumously in 1532.","creator":"Niccolò Machiavelli"},{"id":"LE102-0a67e1725219ccef","title":"Fall of the Giants","kind":"art","reference":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sala_dei_Giganti","aliases":["Fall of the Giants"],"photos":[{"src":"/.netlify/functions/access?action=media&name=bda2353142084bd8a07855f4.webp","credit":"Giulio Romano","license":"Public domain","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Giulio_Rom